{"slug":"quality","title":"质量体系","sections":[{"id":"c8478894-2fa2-4e49-8494-0ee8361a6ede","type":"TEXT_IMAGE","content":{"body":"","heading":"测量服务的质量","bodyHtml":"<p>自成立以来，IGENU 一直在不断改进和发展其服务质量，目标非常明确：</p><p>消费者满意度</p><p>研究并提出完美适应不断变化的客户需求的解决方案</p><p>对于环境分析专家 IGENU 而言，质量是其座右铭。 从设计阶段到生产、销售和最后的售后服务，各级都制定了规则和程序。</p><p>除了这个质量体系之外，其高科技监控领域不仅需要对其员工的技能和资格给予最大的关注，而且还需要对其安全给予最大的关注。</p>","sourceNotes":[{"title":"质量体系","pending":true,"bodyHtml":"<p>重视安全管理，IGENU正在取得“Mase”认证（Safety Improvement Company Manual）</p>","sourceUrl":"http://www.igenu.com/cn/QUALITY.html","capturedAt":"2026-10-21T04:13:22.254Z"}],"imagePosition":"right"},"media":{"id":"344c8a4b-2071-4a60-b39f-ad6293a62421","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"banner3.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","size":285196,"sha256":"3307a46109e89d7eaed9506ca1f29c7b8aba7a378fbc209a464058e044b3367c","width":1200,"height":334,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/3307a46109e89d7eaed9506c.jpg","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.545Z","variants":[{"width":320,"height":89,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/c2eca347f94ac2d9c4a09782.webp"},{"width":640,"height":178,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/8d5b972ba962ee5fc9d277f4.webp"},{"width":960,"height":267,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/81b3cc9a37f8298863f11c79.webp"},{"width":1200,"height":334,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/2dbeda6b0085e4f265d4b25c.webp"}]},"mediaItems":[{"id":"344c8a4b-2071-4a60-b39f-ad6293a62421","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"banner3.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","size":285196,"sha256":"3307a46109e89d7eaed9506ca1f29c7b8aba7a378fbc209a464058e044b3367c","width":1200,"height":334,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/3307a46109e89d7eaed9506c.jpg","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.545Z","variants":[{"width":320,"height":89,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/c2eca347f94ac2d9c4a09782.webp"},{"width":640,"height":178,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/8d5b972ba962ee5fc9d277f4.webp"},{"width":960,"he